BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_WelcomeMultiBattle: @ 8240A8B
	.string "训练家的才能在此\n"
	.string "受到考验！\p"
	.string "欢迎来到对战塔！\n"
	.string "我是负责多人对战房间的\p"
